{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c <strong>Arcanum: A World of Stars and Astrology</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To recover the lost light, the mentor\u00a0Lysimachia and her apprentices, <strong>Helian</strong> and <strong>Oenothera</strong>, continue their training.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under Lysimachia\u2019s guidance, the children\u2014and the player\u2014learn how to read constellations by using stardust and light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453760/extras/2f6915bf0dae579768eda84c9661f852.poster.avif?t=1772464709\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453760/extras/2f6915bf0dae579768eda84c9661f852.webm?t=1772464709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453760/extras/2f6915bf0dae579768eda84c9661f852.mp4?t=1772464709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453760/extras/7aa9ddb371a33d17c7971ef47693306f.avif?t=1772464709\" width=1362 height=765 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Rising Difficulty &amp; New Gimmicks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bound by destiny, the two children set out to find the light of the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the star clusters torn in two, each must solve puzzles separately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll need to ask your partner for clues you can\u2019t see and share your own information\u2014cooperation is everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some puzzles can\u2019t be solved alone, but together, you\u2019ll uncover the constellations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453760/extras/623d73a0d5787673c25848ba2193ce2e.poster.avif?t=1772464709\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453760/extras/623d73a0d5787673c25848ba2193ce2e.webm?t=1772464709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453760/extras/623d73a0d5787673c25848ba2193ce2e.mp4?t=1772464709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its core, this is a game where <strong>teamwork matters</strong>\u2014communication and deduction are key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with a friend and take on the challenge together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play online with a friend, or offline by switching between the perspectives of both characters on your own.<br><strong><i>(Number of players: 1\u20132)</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer mode is currently in development.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\uccab \ubc88\uc9f8 \uc774\uc57c\uae30","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3453760/74235d72ecfba090605202af8c055008ef2d2921.jpg"},{"name":"\ub450 \ubc88\uc9f8 \uc774\uc57c\uae30","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3453760/644e8400740bc156258bb56a3ff7e947d5c26439.jpg"},{"name":"\ubcf5\uc6d0 \uc885\ub8cc","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3453760/5f21ecd0b66c2d9552795cb7928b0542688b93ac.jpg"},{"name":"\ub2e4\uc74c\uc744 \ud5a5\ud574","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3453760/bbac94b5eec56d17f4b2d7ba659691fcd6124bfb.