u00a0Lysimachia and her apprentices, <strong>Helian</strong> and <strong>Oenothera</strong>, continue their training.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under Lysimachia\u2019s guidance, the children\u2014and the player\u2014learn how to read constellations by using stardust and light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453760/extras/2f6915bf0dae579768eda84c9661f852.poster.avif?t=1772464709\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453760/extras/2f6915bf0dae579768eda84c9661f852.webm?t=1772464709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453760/extras/2f6915bf0dae579768eda84c9661f852.mp4?t=1772464709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453760/extras/7aa9ddb371a33d17c7971ef47693306f.avif?t=1772464709\" width=1362 height=765 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Rising Difficulty &amp; New Gimmicks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bound by destiny, the two children set out to find the light of the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the star clusters torn in two, each must solve puzzles separately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll need to ask your partner for clues you can\u2019t see and share your own information\u2014cooperation is everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some puzzles can\u2019t be solved alone, but together, you\u2019ll uncover the constellations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it